            "contentType": "VIDEO",
            "title": "How to build a winning portfolio like a pro",
            "description": "<p>Worried this AI-fueled rally is a bubble waiting to pop? On Trading Pit, <a data-i13n=\"cpos:1;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/stocks-in-translation/\">Stocks in Translation</a> host <a data-i13n=\"cpos:2;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/author/jared-blikre/\">Jared Blikre</a> and <a data-i13n=\"cpos:3;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/videos/series/trader-talk/\">Trader Talk</a> host Kenny Polcari break down how pros really manage risk, from matching your timeframe and goals to using the S&P 500 (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:4;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/%5EGSPC\">^GSPC</a>) as a core benchmark. They walk through sector rotations in healthcare and utilities, show why charts flagged Lululemon (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:5;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/LULU\">LULU</a>) and Palantir (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:6;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/PLTR\">PLTR</a>) as \u201cpriced for perfection,\u201d and explain the volatility trade-off in names like IonQ (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:7;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/IONQ\">IONQ</a>) versus broader tech ETFs. You\u2019ll learn how to avoid accidental overexposure to giants like Apple (<a data-i13n=\"cpos:8;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/quote/AAPL\">AAPL</a>), use basic technicals and P/E ratios, and keep emotions in check as you build a portfolio that can survive the next round of market turbulence.</p>\n<p>For full interviews, highlights, and key insights, check out more from\u00a0<a data-i13n=\"cpos:9;pos:1\" href=\"https://finance.yahoo.com/topic/yf-invest/\">Yahoo Finance Invest</a>.</p>",
            "summary": "Worried this AI-fueled rally is a bubble waiting to pop? On Trading Pit, Stocks in Translation host Jared Blikre and Trader Talk host Kenny Polcari break down how pros really manage risk, from matching your timeframe and goals to using the S&P 500 (^GSPC) as a core benchmark. They walk through sector rotations in healthcare and utilities, show why charts flagged Lululemon (LULU) and Palantir (PLTR) as \u201cpriced for perfection,\u201d and explain the volatility trade-off in names like IonQ (IONQ) versus broader tech ETFs. You\u2019ll learn how to avoid accidental overexposure to giants like Apple (AAPL), use basic technicals and P/E ratios, and keep emotions in check as you build a portfolio that can survive the next round of market turbulence. For full interviews, highlights, and key insights, check out more from&nbsp;Yahoo Finance Invest.",
